OL,3,GNEWSAClients 'cautious' on use of AI,
OL,4,Asays software firm boss
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe chief executive of Northern
OL,7,FIreland's largest software firm has
OL,8,Fsaid UK government clients remain
OL,9,Fcautious about the use of Artificial
OL,10,FIntelligence (AI).
OL,12,FBrendan Mooney was speaking as Kainos
OL,13,Fannounced a record half-year
OL,14,Fperformance with a pre-tax profit of
OL,15,F#36m on sales of #269m.
OL,17,FThe company recently won a #111m
OL,18,F"digital borders" contract with the
OL,19,FHome Office to be delivered over the
OL,20,Fnext four years.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
