OL,3,GNEWSAClients 'cautious' on use of AI,
OL,4,Asays software firm boss
OL,5,
OL,6,FMooney said there were "parallel
OL,7,Fconversations" on AI with "buzz and
OL,8,Fexcitement" about its capabilities on
OL,9,Fone hand and the reality of deploying
OL,10,Fit in large organisations on the other.
